OL,3,GNEWSARings of Power filming allows     
OL,4,AMorfydd Clark to see 'secret bits' of  
OL,5,AWales                                  
OL,7,FActress Morfydd Clark has described how
OL,8,Ffilming Rings of Power allowed her to  
OL,9,Fsee "all these secret bits" of Wales   
OL,10,Fshe had not visited before.            
OL,12,FThe fantasy adventure is set thousands 
OL,13,Fof years before the events of JRR      
OL,14,FTolkien's The Hobbit and Lord of the   
OL,15,FRings in the fictional Middle Earth.   
OL,17,FClark, who is from Penarth, Vale of    
OL,18,FGlamorgan, was able to see parts of her
OL,19,Fown country she had not explored before
OL,20,Fwhile filming the third series of the  
OL,21,FAmazon Prime Video programme.          
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
