OL,3,GNEWSARings of Power filming allows     
OL,4,AMorfydd Clark to see 'secret bits' of  
OL,5,AWales                                  
OL,7,FThe star is reprising her leading role 
OL,8,Fas the fierce elf commander Galadriel -
OL,9,Fand has also admitted how she slipped  
OL,10,Fsome Welsh words into her role.        
